Package: ricebowl-wayland-session
Version: 0.1.0~preview2
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CopyPasteUser
Depends: labwc, waybar, foot, fuzzel, swaylock, dbus-user-session, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr
Recommends: xwayland, swaybg, swayidle, wl-clipboard
Description: Optional preview login sessions for RiceBowl on labwc
 Installs separate Waybar and native RicePlate session chooser entries, a
 small launcher which delegates to the user's RiceBowl installation, and
 desktop-specific portal selection. The native choice is visible only when
 riceplate-native is installed and retains Waybar recovery. It does not
 replace XFCE or change the default login session.
